WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel and place the hands on the floor, fingers pointing back toward the toes.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the elbows and rest the belly on the upper arms.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Extend one leg back, then the other, balancing on the hands.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the body in one long line, gazing slightly forward.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Lower the knees with control and shake out the wrists.
